            <div xml:id="m-0a24da33-dded-4c43-be9b-5cfeebe9313a">
              <lg xml:id="m-cca049e0-4352-42a0-b5ba-2d86d28c7d2b">
                <l xml:id="m-0e3bafd8-c41b-442a-9df3-7212a137781a" facs="#m-de19a111-5d4e-4423-b4e1-b72afdb71ad8" label="text-like">llio Commemorations of the Sunday or of the Feria.</l><l xml:id="m-510fcc20-7410-48fc-9e9e-b050c443c93b" facs="#m-7940029f-1fdf-465f-ad94-debda4e03285" label="text-like">The Twenty-fourth Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-67d288c6-b797-4cd6-b3da-dbd3c2d75acf" facs="#m-89dafb4a-222a-4e4e-81da-40cf94f0456b" label="text-like">At Lauds.</l><l xml:id="m-d2708670-5e33-4825-980d-764766ebe863" facs="#m-e3f9b50d-11ce-4b6c-8a04-cc3c63bd92ce" label="ambiguous">Ant. 1.</l><l xml:id="m-bf128858-192a-472e-9cbb-1f73e632b425" facs="#m-9604abcd-642f-4a98-ac53-874454bc194c" label="lyrics-like">UM vidé-ri-tis “abomina-ti-ônem deso-la-ti¬6¬</l><l xml:id="m-d50d49b1-bae5-41fa-87b1-bc0fd82d4b3b" facs="#m-1e05f5e5-0e8e-41ae-89aa-0427de56a6b0" label="lyrics-like">nis quae dícta est a Dani¬ le prophé-ta, stántem in</l><l xml:id="m-b363e5b0-d8d1-4d64-bc0a-67bf64bdc7a2" facs="#m-da777b72-5e41-47fc-a384-57800cf47204" label="lyrics-like">lóco sáncto: qui lé git, intélligat.</l><l xml:id="m-929ca7e7-12d8-47d7-a78d-d54253aaede5" facs="#m-29533653-a8d1-43c5-b983-bc194e2bcf8d" label="ambiguous">—</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
